{"id":54327,"date":"2026-07-22T07:32:50","date_gmt":"2026-07-22T06:32:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/fatima-games-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-09T08:29:54","modified_gmt":"2026-09-09T07:29:54","slug":"fatima-games","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/fatima-games\/","title":{"rendered":"F\u00e1tima Games 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">F\u00e1tima Games 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>F\u00e1tima Games 2026<\/strong> realizam-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>12 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na arena do <strong>Est\u00e1dio Papa Francisco<\/strong>, em F\u00e1tima (concelho de Our\u00e9m). O evento representa uma das competi\u00e7\u00f5es pioneiras e mais desafiantes de <strong>Fitness Racing em Portugal<\/strong>, combinando segmentos de corrida cont\u00ednua com 8 exigentes esta\u00e7\u00f5es de treino funcional e resist\u00eancia muscular.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O formato competitivo inclui 8 s\u00e9ries de <strong>800 metros de corrida (6,4 km no total)<\/strong> intercaladas com SkiErg (1000m), Slam Ball Throw (100m), Air Bike (3000m), Burpee Broad Jumps (100m), Remo (1000m), Farmer Carry (200m), Dumbbell Walking Lunges (100m) e Wall Balls (100 reps). A prova disputa-se nas categorias de <strong>Duplas<\/strong>, <strong>Relay de Equipas<\/strong>, <strong>Teens<\/strong> e <strong>Kids<\/strong>, distribuindo mais de <strong>2.850 \u20ac em Prize Money<\/strong> aos primeiros classificados com cronometragem oficial Lap2Go.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; 